          <p className="text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed mb-2">
            The fall of Valen was primarily caused by <span className="font-medium">Commander Rael's</span> systematic campaign, which dismantled Valen's northern alliance through strategic betrayals and prolonged siege warfare <CitationBadge n={1} /><CitationBadge n={2} />. Council records confirm deliberate provocation and resource hoarding <CitationBadge n={5} />.
